<!-- Nse Capital Market trimmed structures v6.6: five structures, seventeen transaction codes,
     no Message Header and no Message Length, Pragma Pack(2) with the padding already explicit.
     Trade Confirmation prints SEC_INFO at 110 where the arithmetic puts it at 100, which is what
     is transcribed. Codes 20001 and 20041 name a 132 byte structure no table defines and are
     not transcribed. -->

